# Vibe Scout Rules for Cursor

When the user asks to inspect a sales funnel, audit conversion leaks, or inventory existing assets:
1. Map the full customer journey (Traffic -> Click -> Lead -> Sale -> Retention).
2. Pinpoint the single biggest conversion bottleneck against industry benchmarks.
3. Inventory reusable commercial assets (email lists, testimonials, past copy).
4. Output findings in `reports/scout-<topic>.md`.
